        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Mom is a desktop simulation game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling that your computer desktop is too plain? Want to find a gentle mom to keep you company? Then try this desktop mom!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Instructions:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports gaze tracking with the mouse, dragging, rotating and zooming in and out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag with the left mouse button, rotate with the right mouse button and use the scroll wheel to zoom in and out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right-clicking on the character brings up menu options, which allow for changing costumes and making related settings. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contents:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes a gentle mom character and multiple costumes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Productivity &amp; Cozy Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pomodoro Timer</strong> — Customize focus and break durations to build a comfortable rhythm for work or study.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To-Do List</strong> — Create tasks, organize them into categories, set priorities and track completion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart Reminders</strong> — Schedule one-time or daily reminders for work, study plans, important dates and everyday tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>White Noise Player</strong> — Mix relaxing ambience such as rain, forests and cafés, with independent volume controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy Music Player</strong> — Enjoy curated Cozy / Lofi tracks with categories, favorites, shuffle, repeat and a mini player.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dance with Your Music:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147820/extras/1d0ecf085f1d347a622de15e7ecd7d84.poster.avif?t=1787888199\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147820/extras/1d0ecf085f1d347a622de15e7ecd7d84.webm?t=1787888199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147820/extras/1d0ecf085f1d347a622de15e7ecd7d84.mp4?t=1787888199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from the built-in dance collection, import your own VMD files, and play, loop or smoothly switch between dances whenever you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Link dances to the built-in music player: assign a specific dance to each song, use shuffle, or repeat the current dance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prefer Spotify, YouTube or another music app? Enable external music linking, choose which apps may trigger dancing, and she will start or stop with the music. The built-in player always takes priority.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Motion-aware effects and automatic expressions add a lively touch without stealing the spotlight.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Mom is a desktop simulation game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling that your computer desktop is too plain? Want to find a gentle mom to keep you company? Then try this desktop mom!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Instructions:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports gaze tracking with the mouse, dragging, rotating and zooming in and out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag with the left mouse button, rotate with the right mouse button and use the scroll wheel to zoom in and out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right-clicking on the character brings up menu options, which allow for changing costumes and making related settings. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contents:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes a gentle mom character and multiple costumes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Productivity &amp; Cozy Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pomodoro Timer</strong> — Customize focus and break durations to build a comfortable rhythm for work or study.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To-Do List</strong> — Create tasks, organize them into categories, set priorities and track completion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart Reminders</strong> — Schedule one-time or daily reminders for work, study plans, important dates and everyday tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>White Noise Player</strong> — Mix relaxing ambience such as rain, forests and cafés, with independent volume controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy Music Player</strong> — Enjoy curated Cozy / Lofi tracks with categories, favorites, shuffle, repeat and a mini player.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dance with Your Music:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147820/extras/1d0ecf085f1d347a622de15e7ecd7d84.poster.avif?t=1787888199\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147820/extras/1d0ecf085f1d347a622de15e7ecd7d84.webm?t=1787888199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4147820/extras/1d0ecf085f1d347a622de15e7ecd7d84.mp4?t=1787888199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from the built-in dance collection, import your own VMD files, and play, loop or smoothly switch between dances whenever you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Link dances to the built-in music player: assign a specific dance to each song, use shuffle, or repeat the current dance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prefer Spotify, YouTube or another music app? Enable external music linking, choose which apps may trigger dancing, and she will start or stop with the music. The built-in player always takes priority.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Motion-aware effects and automatic expressions add a lively touch without stealing the spotlight.</p>",
        "short_description": "Your mom is here, come quickly to play happily with your mom.",
